flowchart TB
  Infra["infra/alchemy<br/>Cloudflare stack"]
  Ui["apps/ui<br/>Foldkit app + Website Worker"]
  Server["coffee-server<br/>Coffee Worker, composition root<br/>Durable Objects, D1, Secrets Store"]
  Presentation["presentation<br/>REST (health, menu, me, generated Apis), MCP"]
  Actions["presentation/actions<br/>hand-written tool catalog"]
  Auth["coffee-auth<br/>Yielded passkeys, MCP OAuth"]
  Core["coffee-application<br/>CoffeeOrderApp: menu, pricing, order reads"]
  Domain["coffee-domain<br/>alchemy/Domain model<br/>aggregates, views, policy, Apis"]
  Infra -->|deploys| Server
  Infra -->|deploys| Ui
  Ui -->|Api clients| Domain
  Server -->|mounts| Presentation
  Server -->|sessions| Auth
  Server -->|hosts model + Apis| Domain
  Presentation -->|project tools| Actions
  Presentation -->|call| Core
  Presentation -->|generate REST + MCP tools| Domain
  Actions -->|run| Core
  Core -->|commands + views| Domain
